(O6010 SPINDLE TOOL WEAR + RUNOUT CHECK - REV 5 2026-10-18)
(SET THE VALUES BELOW FOR THE TOOL IN THE SPINDLE, THEN)
(CYCLE START IN MEMORY MODE. RUNS O6009 ON THE SPINDLE TOOL.)
(REV 5: FRONT END FOR O6009 REV D.)
(SUPPORTS B-1.0 WEAR UPDATE AND B-2.0 CHECK ONLY MODES.)
(SUPPORTS LOLLIPOP CUTTERS VIA K=-5 WITH I AND V ANGLES.)
(GUARANTEES ZERO CUTTER COMP AND USES NATIVE BLUM #115.)
(C MUST BE THE FLUTE COUNT AT THE MEASURING HEIGHT.)
(RUN STANDALONE ONLY. FROM ANOTHER PROGRAM CALL O6009 DIRECTLY -)
(G65 P6010 WOULD EXCEED THE C00 LIMIT OF 4 NESTED G65 CALLS.)
#1 = 1.5875 (D - NOMINAL DIAMETER MM. 1/16 IN = 1.5875)
#2 = 4. (C - NUMBER OF FLUTES. MUST BE EXACT)
#3 = -1. (K - 0 FLAT, -1 BALL, -3 DRILL, -4 T-SLOT, -5 LOLLIPOP)
(CORNER RAD = BULLNOSE)
#4 = -1. (B - -1.0 WEAR UPDATE [DEFAULT], -2.0 CHECK ONLY)
#5 = 25. (I - LOLLIPOP START ANGLE DEG, USED IF K = -5)
#6 = 135. (V - LOLLIPOP END ANGLE DEG, USED IF K = -5)
(GUARANTEE ZERO CUTTER COMP BEFORE CALL)
#[13000 + FIX[#3700]] = 0.0000
#580 = 0.0
#115 = [#1 / 2.]
M159
G65 P6009 T#3700 D#1 C#2 K#3 B#4 I#5 V#6
(RESTORE MODAL AND VERIFY CLEANUP)
#115 = 0.0
#[13000 + FIX[#3700]] = 0.0000
#580 = 0.0
M159
M30
